# Never commit spreadsheet round-trips or OS cruft — the CSV is canonical.

*.xlsx
*.xls
~$*
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.code-workspace

# Local, per-user agent settings (permission grants etc.); a shared
# .claude/settings.json may still be committed if the team wants one.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Proposal staging. An assistant coding session writes its rows, generators and
# review notes into proposed/ or proposed-<dataset>/ before anything is applied,
# so that the standalone CSVs can be read against the diff. They are working
# artefacts of one session, not part of the deposit: the rows themselves live in
# data.csv and the reasoning lives in the logbooks, both of which are tracked.
# Ignored so that an untracked staging folder never reads as pending work.
proposed*/

# Transfer archives used to move a session's output onto this machine. Deleted
# once unpacked; ignored so a leftover never gets committed.
_transfer*.tar
